// The launcher's icon (#78): morpheus284's (CC BY 4.0, assets\ui\morpheus284\icon.png, made into an icon of
// seven sizes); the earlier one, our own drawing, is coreoflight.ico (tools/make_icon.ps1). The first icon is
// what Explorer and shortcuts show; main.cpp gives it to the window too.
1 ICON "coreoflight_morpheus284.ico"

// morpheus284's frames and background for the start screen (#78, CC BY 4.0: assets\ui\morpheus284\README.md),
// as PNG / JPEG data; textures.h LoadUiTexture decodes them. The numbers are kUiCardBase... in textures.h.
101 RCDATA "..\\assets\\ui\\morpheus284\\card_base.png"
102 RCDATA "..\\assets\\ui\\morpheus284\\card_light.png"
103 RCDATA "..\\assets\\ui\\morpheus284\\option_bar.png"
104 RCDATA "..\\assets\\ui\\morpheus284\\background.jpg"
